  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "createFile",
      "targetFolder": "",
      "fileName": "",
      "id": "7aca0bc7-b63f-410c-9e81-c611cf799f52",
      "filePath": "学习/项目/{{@项目名称}}.md",
      "conflictResolution": "skip",
      "contentTemplateSource": "text",
      "content": "---\n领域:\n  - \"[[学习]]\"\n类型:\n  - 项目\n项目:\n  - {{@项目名称}}\n相关项目:\n状态: {{@状态}}\n创建时间: {{date:YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss}}\n---\n\n## 相关\n\n```dataview\nTABLE 类型, 状态, 创建时间\nFROM \"\"\nWHERE contains(项目, this.file.link)\nSORT 创建时间 DESC\n```\n"
    }
  ],
  "autoSubmit": false
